 "description": "<p><b>Overview:</b></p><p>Comfortable and Cozy: This cat hammock bed features durable canvas material with options for both summer and winter versions. The winter version includes soft plush to keep your feline friend warm and snug during colder months.</p><p>Adjustable Straps: Designed with adjustable hanging straps, this hammock allows you to customize the height and fit, ensuring a secure and comfortable setup in any pet cage or other fixed hanging areas.</p><p>Versatile Sizes and Patterns: Available in multiple sizes and charming patterns, this hammock can cater to different breeds and preferences, making it a stylish and functional addition to your pet's environment.</p><p>Easy Installation: Simple to install and adjust, this pet hammock can be conveniently attached to any cage or suitable hanging space, providing your cat with a own space, elevated lounging spot.</p><p>Seasonal Options: Choose between the breathable summer version for warmth and the cozy, plush winter option for extra comfort, ensuring your pet enjoys the perfect resting place year-round.</p><p><b><br/></b></p><p><b>Product information:</b><br/>Color: 27-27,35-35,53-35,57-47<br/> Specifications: Red XINGX (adjustable) autumn and winter, blue XINGX (adjustable) autumn and winter, gray XINGX (adjustable) autumn and winter, white and blue stripes (adjustable) autumn and winter, gray plaid (adjustable) autumn and winter, red XINGX (adjustable) spring and autumn, Blue Star (adjustable) spring and autumn, Gray Star (adjustable) spring and autumn, white and blue striped (adjustable) spring and autumn, gray plaid (adjustable) spring and autumn<br/> Material: cloth<br/> Applicable object: Cat<br/> Category: pet bed, Cage</p>\n <br/>\n <b>Packing list: </b>\n <br/>1*Cat Nest \n <br/>\n \n <b>Product Image:</b>\n <br/>\n <img src=\"https://oss-cf.cjdropshipping.com/product/2024/08/14/05/0d1201bc-113f-405e-bd49-363ed94e58ea_trans.jpeg\"/>\n <img src=\"https://oss-cf.cjdropshipping.com/pro